'' 'let( foo ) = f( )' -- ONE name in a multiple assignment takes the UDT's FIRST field (fbc's
'' expressions/mult-assign.bas). tiko built an N_PAREN, assigned the whole UDT and declined. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/let-one-target.bas -o tests/codegen/letonetarget.exe
